	(descr "Amphenol CDI TMB-V5F2-3LC 3.5mm female vertical solderless compression connector. Mechanical dimensions from manufacturer Rev 5. Launch adapted as a starting point for PCBWay 6-layer Stackup #1: L1-L2 0.1195mm, Er 4.45, finished outer Cu 35um. 0.22mm GCPW strip / 0.15mm top-ground gap. Includes In1.Cu 1.30mm antipad and PCBWay-friendly 0.20/0.50mm ground vias. Verify final impedance with PCBWay.")
